      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 2,
          "section": "3. Results",
          "quote": "As can be seen from Fig. 3, the grain size is relatively uniform with an average grain diameter of /C24 30 μm. Under this homogenization condition, individual grains tended to grow abnormally, as shown in Fig. 3(b). Nevertheless, the microstructure is basically uniform as shown in Fig. 3(a), which can meet the needs of subsequent experiments.",
