      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "section": "3. Results",
          "quote": "Compared with the cold-rolled microstructure of the two processes, the slight difference is that the rolling strips are arranged regularly and neatly under the LHU-CR process, as shown by the red arrows in Fig. 4a, while the irregular deformation zones accumulated between the rolling strips due to multiple compression under the MLR-CR process are obvious as shown by the red arrows in Fig. 4b.",
